<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 YOHANE</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Yo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">YOHANE NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANE</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="ip">Mmerɛ bɔ Yohane hworɔle 1 Yohane ne, enu berɛ ala wɔ afoɛ 98 Y.A <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> yeɛ ɔhworɔle 2 Yohane ne 3 Yohane ne. Na sɔ mmerɛ ne de, ne ɔkeka kɔ afoɛ 100. Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle ye krataa nabo yeɛ ole “<char style="it">Me bɔ nde panyi ne, mefa krataa he mebrɛ bra panyi bɔ baye ye, ɔne ye mmaa mɔ</char>.” Ebiemɔ nwu ye kyɛ, ebia <char style="it">bra panyi</char> ne yeɛ ole asafo bɔ né ɔwɔ berɛ ne; ebiemɔ koso nwu ye kyɛ, ne ɔte aliemaa brasua bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Greek nu kyɛ <char style="bdit">Kyria</char> (Yebo kyire bra panyi.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ sɔ krataa he anu ne, né enu biemɔ wɔ ye krataa bɔ oli moa nanu. Ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ, odikyɛ Kristofoɛ dodɔ bɛ nwo. Yeɛ osa bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ wɔ bɛ bɔ bɛte <char style="bdit">Antikristo</char> nanwo. Ne sɔ mmenia hemɔ ka kyɛ Kristo amma anwoɔnaen nu.―<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:7">2Yo 7</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane maa atiefoɛ nemɔ nwuni asane bɔ ɔwɔ nu kyɛ bɛkole sɔ mmenia nemɔ bɛkɔwa b'awuro. Yeti ɔhane kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔtena Kristo ngyerɛkyerɛ nu ne, ole Baba ne né Baa ne. Na ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie ba ɛmɔ berɛ, ná ottira sɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ he a, nnɛmɔ dɛ́ ye bɛkɔ ɛmɔ awuro, na nnɛmɔ kyea ye po.” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:10">2Yo 10</ref></char>) Ɛhe kyire kyɛ ne sɔ dwirɛ nanwo hia paa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Oyie ye dwirɛ ne, ɔhane kyɛ ɔkɔɔsra bɛ, na ɔne bɛ ali ngɔmmɔ pee.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:12">2Yo 12</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛnate nahorɛ nanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">1:4-6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ bɛ bɔ bɛlaka-laka nanwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">1:7-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɔhyea ɛmɔ nwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:10-11">1:10-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nzrahwɛ ne ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Me bɔ nde panyi ne,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2JN 1:1">Mefa krataa he mebrɛ bra panyi bɔ baye ye, ɔne ye mmaa mɔ bɔ medɔ bɛ paa ne. Nná me ngome yeɛ medɔ bɛ ɔ, bɛ bɔ banwu nahorɛ namukoraati ne koso dɔ ɛmɔ, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />ofikyɛ nahorɛ ne te yɛ nu, na ɔne yɛ kɔtena daa.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Adom, anwunvoin ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ, ne ɔwa Yesu Kristo berɛ ha yɛ wɔ nahorɛ ne ɔdɔ nu.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Mmerɛ bɔ nwuni kyɛ wɔ mmaa ne biemɔ nate nahorɛ nanu, kyɛbɔ Baba ne ahyɛ ne, me nye gyele paa. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Nakoso bra panyi, kesaalae de mesrɛ wɔ, ɛmɔma yɛdodɔ yɛ nwo. Ɛhe de, nná mmeraa foforɛ bie yeɛ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ɔ, mmom mmeraa bɔ ahyɛaseɛ ne, yɛnyane ye nala. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Na bɔ ɔdɔ ne kyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛkoli ye ahyɛdeɛ so. Na ahyɛdeɛ ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔ nate ɔdɔ nu kyɛbɔ ofi ahyɛaseɛ ne, ɛmɔtele ne. <verse eid="2JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Ofikyɛ nnaka-nnakafoɛ pee awa wiase, sɔ mmenia nemɔ nne ndonu<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mbakye nu nga kyɛ”</char></note> kyɛ Yesu Kristo wale anwoɔnaen nu. Ebiala bɔ ɔte sɔ ne laka-laka mmenia, na ɔte <char style="tl">antikristo</char>. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Ɛmɔnea yé, na bɔ yafɛ yanya ye ne amvi yɛ sa, mmom ɛmɔ anya akatua bɔ odi mu.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Ebiala bɔ ɔpere ye nwo di anyunu, na ɔndena Kristo ngyerɛkyerɛ nu ne, ɔnze Nyameɛ. Na bɔ ɔtena Ye ngyerɛkyerɛ nu ne de, ɔse Baba ne né Baa ne. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Sɛ ebie ba ɛmɔ berɛ, ná ottira sɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ he a, nnɛmɔ dɛ́ ye bɛkɔ ɛmɔ awuro, na nnɛmɔ kyea ye po. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔhyea sɔ sona ne, ɔboka ye bɔne naso.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Nne edwirɛ pee bɔ odikyɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ɔ, nakoso menguro kyɛ metworɔ ye wɔ krataa so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ tee: “Mefa krataa ne pɛn metworɔ.”</char></note> Mmom mese kyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ ngɔwa ngɔɔnea ɛmɔ boso, na yali ngɔmmɔ. Na wamaa y'anigye ali mu.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Eliema brasua bɔ baye ye ne, ye mmaa nemɔ nwa bɛkyea wɔ.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>